**Findings (posted)**
- `MUST-FIX` `src/cli/commands/session.ts:2080`: budget validation uses `parseInt`, so malformed inputs like `3.5` / `3abc` are accepted.
- `MUST-FIX` `src/sessions/store.ts:1772`: `validateSessionId()` exists but is not integrated into command read paths, so `ac-invalid-session` is not actually implemented end-to-end.
- `MUST-FIX` `src/cli/commands/session.ts:2088` + `tests/session-create.test.ts:477`: trait exit-code ACs are annotated as covered while the code/tests use exit code `2` instead of trait-required `1`.
- `MUST-FIX` `tests/session-create.test.ts:407`: inherited trait AC test annotations are incomplete.
- `MUST-FIX` `tests/session-create.test.ts:243`: `ac-inject-claude` / `ac-inject-codex` are only unit-tested via helpers, not through `session create --inject` + harness detection.
- `SHOULD-FIX` `src/sessions/store.ts:1666`: invalid JSON in config files is silently overwritten (data-loss risk).

Checks run:
- `gh pr diff 500`
- `gh pr view 500 --json title,body,files`
- `kspec task get @implement-session-create-command`
- `kspec item get @session-creation-and-env-injection`
